    # "As I made my way out through the city gates, I heard a voice calling behind me."
    "当我走出城门时，听到身后有个声音在呼喊。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:5
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_def3145f:

    # UNKNOWN "Wait! STOPPPP!"
    UNKNOWN "等等！站住——！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:9
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_5d48b0bd:

    # "Behind me, a young boy, huffing and panting, sprinted up and handed me a sealed letter."
    "身后一个年轻男孩气喘吁吁地跑来，递给我一封密封的信件。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:11
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_6394fbb0:

    # UNKNOWN "{i}*Huff!*{/i} An urgent letter for you mi'lord from Captain 妮克斯!"
    UNKNOWN "{i}*呼哧！*{/i} 妮克斯队长给您的紧急信件，大人！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:12
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_09b56699:

    # MC @ talk "Captain 妮克斯? Did she say what this was about?"
    MC @ talk "妮克斯队长？她说了是什么事吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:13
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_a2c653f8:

    # UNKNOWN "No mi'lord! But she said you must read it at once!"
    UNKNOWN "没有，大人！但她说您必须立即阅读！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:14
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_f2d783ef:

    # MC @ talk "How did you know where to-"
    MC @ talk "你怎么知道去哪里——"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:19
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_67ca6e19:

    # "The boy was already hurrying off once again before I could even finish my sentence, sprinting back towards the gate, and soon, he was gone entirely from my line of sight."
    "还没等我说完，男孩就又匆忙跑开了，朝着城门飞奔而去，很快便完全消失在我的视线中。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:20
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_a26e1014:

    # "I tore open the letter and read its contents inside."
    "我撕开信件阅读其中的内容。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:23
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_cbb5587c:

    # "{i}I need to call upon your services once again.{/i}"
    "{i}我需要再次请求你的协助。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:24
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_d2dd0882:

    # "{i}Captain 妮克斯{/i}"
    "{i}妮克斯队长{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:26
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_intro_a54258cb:

    # MC "(I should head over there once I have some time, see what she wants.)"
    MC "(我应该抽空去一趟，看看她想要什么。)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:40
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_2224139c:

    # NYX @ talk "Ah, there you are."
    NYX @ talk "啊，你来了。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:41
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_0a23a13b:

    # NYX @ talk "Just the person I've been looking for."
    NYX @ talk "正是我要找的人。"

# game/data/world_quests/sside/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:42
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_756e61c9:

    # MC @ think "What's this about?"
    MC @ think "这是关于什么的事？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:43
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_29d937a5:

    # NYX @ talk "Not long ago, we received word of a notorious slave master who we {i}think{/i} has arrived in Novaras."
    NYX @ talk "不久前，我们收到消息，一个恶名昭彰的奴隶主{i}可能{/i}已经来到了诺瓦拉斯。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:44
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_8efb590f:

    # NYX @ angry "They call him 'Angharad of a thousand chains.'"
    NYX @ angry "他们称他为'千链安格哈拉德'。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:45
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_a7e01fe2:

    # NYX @ talk "From what we've gathered, Angharad's been investing a lot of time and resources in the power struggle going on between the gangs in the city right now, and has struck some type of deal with the Khazahs."
    NYX @ talk "据我们收集的情报，安格哈拉德正在投入大量时间和资源参与城内帮派间的权力斗争，并与卡扎赫帮达成了某种协议。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:46
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_96b86ea7:

    # NYX @ talk "We believe he's been supplying them with additional weapons, drugs, and armour in return for being the only slave master they consult with."
    NYX @ talk "我们相信他一直在向他们提供额外的武器、毒品和盔甲，以换取成为他们唯一咨询的奴隶主。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:47
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_b8ea4e4b:

    # MC @ think "I see... And where do I fit into all this?"
    MC @ think "我明白了...那我在其中扮演什么角色？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:48
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_2fed62ec:

    # NYX @ angry "We've managed to convince Angharad to attend what he believes is a business meeting with another high-profile slaver interested in working with him."
    NYX @ angry "我们设法说服安格哈拉德参加一个他认为是与另一位有意与他合作的重要奴隶主的商务会议。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:49
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_55bd058f:

    # NYX @ talk "The plan is simple ... One of our men pretends to be the other slave master, goes in, finds proof it's definately Angharad at the meeting and not one of his men sent on his behalf,"
    NYX @ talk "计划很简单...我们的人假扮成另一位奴隶主进去，找到确凿证据证明参加会议的是安格哈拉德本人而不是他派来的手下，"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:50
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_0a8956f7:

    # NYX @ talk "And once Angharad is confirmed to be present and agrees to the deal, the other city guards on standby will swarm the place and seize him."
    NYX @ talk "一旦确认安格哈拉德在场并同意交易，待命的城市卫兵就会涌进来逮捕他。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:51
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_8eb76fb4:

    # MC @ talk "I take it this is where I come in?"
    MC @ talk "我想这就是需要我出场的地方？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:52
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_ab17c8ac:

    # NYX @ talk "Well, aren't you clever?"
    NYX @ talk "嗯，你不是挺聪明吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:53
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_1dd21de2:

    # NYX @ talk "As you know, I'm stretched thin on manpower as it is, but to make matters worse, Angharad's done his research and knows who many of my men are."
    NYX @ talk "如你所知，我的人手已经很紧张了，但更糟的是，安格哈拉德做了调查，认识我很多手下。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:54
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_0e67101c:

    # NYX @ talk "I need a fresh face to go in and pretend to be the other slave master to negotiate with him."
    NYX @ talk "我需要一张新面孔进去假扮成另一位奴隶主与他谈判。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:55
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_3635700b:

    # NYX @ talk "Are we clear?"
    NYX @ talk "清楚了吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:59
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_426d1e67:

    # NYX @ talk "I'll walk you through everything as best as I can, just push the thought of 'people' to the back of your mind and remember it's {i}product{/i} you're discussing."
    NYX @ talk "我会尽力指导你，只需把'人'的概念抛在脑后，记住你讨论的是{i}商品{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:60
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_ab611a5e:

    # NYX @ talk "Assisting you will be one of my very best pretending to be a slave concubine of yours."
    NYX @ talk "我的一位精英会假扮成你的奴隶妾室来协助你。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:66
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_94a5723b:

    # NYX @ angry "We need to confirm it's really him."
    NYX @ angry "我们需要确认真的是他本人。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:67
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_811f98c6:

    # NYX @ talk "In the past, he's sent others impersonating him to handle negotiations."
    NYX @ talk "过去他曾派别人冒充他进行谈判。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:68
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_0a4a920a:

    # NYX @ angry "We can't let him slip away, no matter what."
    NYX @ angry "无论如何都不能让他溜走。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:69
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_6817b429:

    # MC @ talk "And how will I be able to {i}'prove'{/i} it's really him?"
    MC @ talk "那我如何能{i}'证明'{/i}真的是他本人呢？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:70
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_6363e661:

    # NYX @ sad "That's the tricky part ... But we'll have to find it."
    NYX @ sad "这就是棘手的地方...但我们必须找到方法。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:71
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_61767dca:

    # NYX @ talk "If we arrest one his men acting on his behalf, Angharad will only hide himself further underground."
    NYX @ talk "如果我们逮捕他派来的代表，安格哈拉德只会更深地隐藏起来。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:74
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_3d8f1a37:

    # NYX @ talk "Any other questions?"
    NYX @ talk "还有其他问题吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:77
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_f2a55cd8:

    # NYX @ angry "Angharad is no ordinary slave master, he's destabilised whole regions before."
    NYX @ angry "安格哈拉德不是普通的奴隶主，他之前曾让整个地区陷入动荡。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:78
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_6970770f:

    # NYX @ talk "If we capture him alive, we can use his connections to weed out dozens if not hundreds of criminals in the city."
    NYX @ talk "如果我们活捉他，就能利用他的关系网揪出城里数十甚至数百名罪犯。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:79
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_935cb587:

    # NYX @ angry "But, if he entrenches himself here before we can do that, we'll never be able to uproot him."
    NYX @ angry "但如果在那之前他在这里站稳脚跟，我们就永远无法铲除他。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:85
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_5617f1f3:

    # NYX @ talk "So then, can I count on you with this?"
    NYX @ talk "那么，我能指望你吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:88
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_219c9373:

    # NYX @ laugh "My undying gratitude?"
    NYX @ laugh "我不朽的感激？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:89
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_b212ba9d:

    # MC @ talk "Nice try."
    MC @ talk "想得美。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:90
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_a53116a5:

    # NYX @ angry "Fine, what do you want?"
    NYX @ angry "好吧，你想要什么？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:93
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_3270b237:

    # NYX @ talk "Fine, how does six hundred sound?"
    NYX @ talk "好吧，六百怎么样？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:96
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_95795d08:

    # NYX @ talk "Fine ... Seven-fifty and not a coin more."
    NYX @ talk "好吧...七百五，一个子儿都不能多了。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:102
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_675f81f3:

    # NYX @ shock "Equipment?"
    NYX @ shock "装备？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:103
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_43854ff0:

    # NYX @ talk "Well ... I could give you some health potions, and, while I can't give you any armour and weapons,"
    NYX @ talk "嗯...我可以给你一些治疗药水，虽然我不能给你任何盔甲和武器，"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:104
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_99899405:

    # NYX @ talk "I can give you this amulet that offers some protection."
    NYX @ talk "但我可以给你这个提供一些保护的护身符。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:107
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_fd5c4a81:

    # NYX @ laugh "Excellent."
    NYX @ laugh "太好了。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:111
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_b5146dc2:

    # NYX @ disg "You ... you what?!"
    NYX @ disg "你...你什么？！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:112
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_c3ccfe27:

    # NYX @ angry "Be serious!"
    NYX @ angry "认真点！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:115
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_9d4d3b62:

    # NYX @ angry "Ask me that again and I'll cut your balls off!"
    NYX @ angry "再问一次我就阉了你！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:118
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_a1946fb6:

    # NYX @ arrogant "It ... It doesn't even make any sense asking for my panties!"
    NYX @ arrogant "这...这甚至毫无意义，居然要我的内裤！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:119
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_c8668323:

    # NYX @ arrogant "What benefit are they to you?"
    NYX @ arrogant "这对你有什么好处？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:121
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_fef62dd5:

    # MC @ lewd "Doesn't it make even less sense to deny me?"
    MC @ lewd "拒绝我不是更没道理吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:123
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_1fc525bf:

    # NYX @ disg "W-What are you talking about?"
    NYX @ disg "你-你在说什么？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:124
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_3b140a9a:

    # MC @ lewd "Rather than waste precious resources, all I ask for are the panties you're wearing."
    MC @ lewd "与其浪费宝贵的资源，我只要你现在穿的内裤。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:125
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_55b415c4:

    # MC @ lewd "What better deal could you get than that?"
    MC @ lewd "还有什么比这更好的交易？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:127
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_68f36c38:

    # NYX @ arrogant "... F-Fine."
    NYX @ arrogant "...好-好吧。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:128
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_3cc6f07a:

    # NYX @ arrogant "But this degradation will not be forgotten!"
    NYX @ arrogant "但这种羞辱我不会忘记！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:129
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_f944af57:

    # MC @ lewd "Oh, I'm sure it won't."
    MC @ lewd "哦，我相信不会。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:131
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_cf4f3f87:

    # NYX @ angry "And no payment till AFTER the job is done!"
    NYX @ angry "而且任务完成前不会支付！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:132
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_317840ab:

    # MC @ smile "Of course, I always live up to my end of the deal."
    MC @ smile "当然，我向来守信。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:134
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_e37719bc:

    # "Captain 妮克斯 pouted at the comment as her cheeks burned red."
    "妮克斯队长听到这句话撅起了嘴，脸颊烧得通红。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:138
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_4e5d8af1:

    # NYX @ angry "Now that's out of the way, can we focus on the task at hand please?"
    NYX @ angry "既然这件事解决了，我们能专注于手头的任务吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:140
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_5344b784:

    # MC @ talk "What needs to be done first?"
    MC @ talk "首先需要做什么？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:141
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_15acb208:

    # "From her table, Captain 妮克斯 handed me a selection of sheets."
    "妮克斯队长从桌上递给我一些文件。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:142
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_787b7698:

    # NYX @ talk "Wrote here are some details about various trade routes and things, as well as the common price of raza and slaves these days."
    NYX @ talk "这里写了一些关于各种贸易路线等事情的细节，以及如今拉扎和奴隶的普遍价格。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:143
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_6577aed4:

    # NYX @ talk "These things are common knowledge for any trader, and even more so for a criminal like Angharad."
    NYX @ talk "这些对任何商人来说都是常识，对安格哈拉德这样的罪犯更是如此。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:144
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_827983a1:

    # NYX @ talk "Learn these things well, and report back to me when you're ready to begin the next part of our plan."
    NYX @ talk "好好学这些东西，准备好开始下一部分计划时向我汇报。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:150
translate zh qsttheslavemaster_pitch_menu_0ce9d935:

    # NYX @ talk "Have you read the book thoroughly?"
    NYX @ talk "你仔细读过那本书了吗？"

